# The mutation harnesses match multi-line `find` strings against these files
# literally. A CRLF checkout makes every multi-line mutant miss, which the VAL-001
# harness then misreports as "the guard was refactored". Pin LF so the result is
# the same on every platform and in every fresh clone.
*.js   text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.cjs  text eol=lf
*.ts   text eol=lf
*.tsx  text eol=lf
*.mts  text eol=lf
*.cts  text eol=lf
*.jsx  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.sql  text eol=lf
